{"name":"Enchanted","hex":"#c9e2cf","fetched":"2026-10-16","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"enchanted","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Verb","definitions":["simple past and past participle of enchant"]},{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Charmed, delighted, enraptured.","Under the influence of enchantment."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/enchanted"}],"entries":[{"title":"Enchanted (film)","blocks":[{"text":"Enchanted is a 2007 American live action/animated musical fantasy comedy film directed by Kevin Lima and written by Bill Kelly. Co-produced by Walt Disney Pictures, Josephson Entertainment, and Right Coast Productions, the film stars Amy Adams, Patrick Dempsey, James Marsden, Timothy Spall, Idina Menzel, and Susan Sarandon, with Julie Andrews as the narrator. It focuses on an archetypal Disney princess-to-be named Giselle, who is exiled from her animated world into the live-action world of the New York metropolitan area, where she falls in love with a divorce lawyer."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/2/2a/Enchantedposter.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Enchanted_(film)"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/2/2a/Enchantedposter.jpg/250px-Enchantedposter.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/2/2a/Enchantedposter.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/2/2a/Enchantedposter.jpg/250px-Enchantedposter.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AEnchantedposter.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/12/Amy_Adams_UK_Nocturnal_Animals_Premiere_%28cropped%29.jpg/500px-Amy_Adams_UK_Nocturnal_Animals_Premiere_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_